## Quick Reference: Configuration Summary

**Vonage Side:**
```
SIP Trunk: LiveKit Trunk
Region: AMER / EMEA / APAC

Inbound (Origination):
  → SIP URI: sip:your-livekit-server.com:5060
  → Transport: UDP

Outbound Auth:
  → Authorized IPs: Your LiveKit Server Public IP

Outbound Termination Host:
  → AMER: sip-us.vonage.com
  → EMEA: sip-eu.vonage.com
  → APAC: sip-ap.vonage.com

Numbers:
  → Forwarded from Numbers → Your Numbers → SIP Trunking
```

**LiveKit Side:**
```
Inbound Trunk:
  → Name: Vonage Inbound
  → Number Format: +E.164 (WITH +)
  → Numbers: Your Vonage number
  → Allowed Addresses: Vonage egress CIDR list (from KB article)
  → Auth: None (IP whitelist only)

Dispatch Rule:
  → Linked to: Vonage Inbound trunk
  → Type: Direct/Individual/Multi-Line (your choice)
  → Agent: Your AI agent

Outbound Trunk:
  → Name: Vonage Outbound
  → Address: sip-us.vonage.com / sip-eu.vonage.com / sip-ap.vonage.com
  → Transport: UDP
  → Number Format: +E.164 (WITH +)
  → Numbers: Your Vonage number
  → Auth: None (IP whitelist only)
```

